flowchart LR
  Library[Selected library tracks] --> Analysis[Local analysis]
  Analysis --> Design[Deterministic v4 design snapshot]
  Design --> Arrangement[OpenRouter chooses measured transition candidates]
  Arrangement --> Compile[Deterministic FFmpeg compiler]
  Compile --> Candidate[Candidate MP3 and append-only manifest]
  Candidate --> Technical[Technical quality gate]
  Technical -->|passes| Musical[OpenRouter reviews rendered audio]
  Technical -->|invalid but preserved| Review[Candidate Review]
  Musical -->|safe correction| Compile
  Musical -->|recommended or no safe correction| Options{Need another distinct option?}
  Options -->|yes and capacity remains| Arrangement
  Options -->|no or limit reached| Review
  Review --> Human[Human chooses a technically valid draft]
  Human --> Promotion[Journaled final MP3 promotion]
  Promotion --> History[History and wisdom projections]
  History --> Verified[Verified final MP3 and completed state]
